Subject: Factorial Nested ANOVA?
Message-ID: <QxvaUFKF9Dk.LY3cvHQaFwAJ@geomorph-r-package.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/geomorph-r-package/c/QxvaUFKF9Dk/m/LY3cvHQaFwAJ>
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Dear all,

Is it possible to nest factor Tree inside factors Population and Sex when performing factorial MANOVA with procD.lm function?

I would like to test for population-specific differences between sexes, but taking in account that leaves from the same Tree are more likely to be similar.

Best regards,
Milena

From u4d71c6e24fb21497 at groups.google.com  Tue Jan 17 15:46:31 2017
